  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nAsbury Park, New Jersey — On Monday, August 25, 2025, at approximately 8:44am, Asbury Park Police Department (APPD) units were dispatched to 510 Prospect Avenue following a report of a working structure fire. Upon arrival, officers observed heavy smoke and flames coming from the residence. An 8-year-old juvenile emerged from a second-floor window, jumped, and was caught by Officer Dewitt Bacon, Officer John Walsh, and area resident Joseph Dunbar, who worked together to safely bring the child to the ground. The juvenile was immediately transferred to the Asbury Park Fire Department (APFD) and transported to a local hospital for treatment of smoke inhalation and further evaluation. APFD personnel successfully extinguished the fire. The cause of the fire remains under investigation by Monmouth County Fire Marshals. In addition to APPD and APFD, Asbury Park Social Services and the American Red Cross responded to assist residents with immediate needs and housing placement.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Bobby Roach\n- Sarin Dipity\n- Becky Hopkins\n- Bryan Wilson\n- Wolfey Estep\n- Bagpiper Joshua Agee\n- thomas\n- 'PrussianBlue'\n- Cody Stephens\n- Daniel G\n- David, Guershom\n- 'K9 Kampers with Alfredo'\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- '10izshoe'\n- 'DerLitti86'\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- Brandon M.\n- Jesse\n- Jeff Short\n- RayJayOB\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- James Pringle\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- 'Brother.Legal'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- Zach Williams\n- Michael R Sheffield\n- Rich Biggs\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- 'Necko'\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSupport us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/PoliceActivity\nFollow us on X: https